==Event Information==
Third Impact threatens the Cat Empire! The {{Color|#FF0000|'''EVANGELION'''}} and Battle Cats Crossover Event is back!<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''July 18th (11am) through August 1st, 2019!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Evangelion Collab Capsules!'''}}<br>
Collect special Battle Cats versions of your favorite Evangelion characters in this special crossover Rare Capsule set!<br>
Along with all the powerful returning units only available during this collab event, this second edition of the Evangelion campaign includes all new characters {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Eva Unit-08, AAA Wunder, Misato Katsuragi, Ritsuko Akagi, and Rei Ayanami (???)'''}}. Plus, new True Forms for {{Color|#FF0000|'''Eva Unit-02'''}} and {{Color|#FF6D01|'''Asuka Langley'''}}!!!

You might collect...<br>
[[EVA Unit-08 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Eva Unit-08 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Long-range Area Attacks have a chance to knockback, freeze and weaken Floating enemies, and deliver extra damage to Eva Angel type enemies while taking less damage from them!<br>
[[AAA Wunder (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''AAA Wunder (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks deliver massive damage to Angels and Zombies!<br>
[[EVA Unit-00 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#335599|'''Eva Unit-00 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Angels & Floating, and negates Wave attacks! Area attacks gain increased damage and defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[EVA Unit-01 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#9900FF|'''Eva Unit-01 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong versus Alien & Zombie enemies! Area attacks power up as it takes damage, and destroys Barriers! Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[EVA Unit-02 (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Eva Unit-02 (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Long-Range Area strikes and massive damage vs Red enemies!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Shinji Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#1ECCFF|'''Shinji Cat (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Knocks back Metal & Black with area-effect Wave Attacks!<br>
[[Moon Operators (Uber Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Moon Operators (Uber Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks slow Red & Zombies! Plus, kills Zombies permanently and prevents them from reviving!<br>
[[Rei Ayanami (???) (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Rei Ayanami (???) (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Tough vs Black enemies, with a chance to Weaken them!<br>
Delivers extra damage to Eva Angel enemies, while taking less damage from them!<br>
[[Misato Katsuragi (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Misato Katsuragi (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to break barriers and Slow Aliens!<br>
[[Ritsuko Akagi (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#9900FF|'''Ritsuko Akagi (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks have a chance to weaken Aliens!<br>
[[Rei Ayanami (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF00CC|'''Rei Ayanami (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Area attacks might weaken Angels!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Asuka Langley (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Asuka Langley (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs. Red Enemies, with Area Attack!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Mari Illustrious (Super Rare Cat)|{{Color|#008000|'''Mari Illustrious (Super Rare)'''}}]]<br>
Strong vs. Floating, with Area Attack!<br>
Plus, has increased damage AND defense versus Eva Angels!<br>
[[Rei Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Rei Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF0000|''','''}} [[Asuka Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Asuka Cat'''}}]]{{Color|#FF0000|''','''}} [[Mari Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Mari Cat'''}}]] {{Color|#FF0000|'''(Rare)'''}}<br>
Awesome limited edition Cat versions of the Evangelion heroes!<br>
<small><small>※ During the crossover campaign period, you will have a set chance to collect one of the Evangelion collab units from the Evangelion capsule set. Evangelion units can not be collected from other Rare Capsule sets. Please make sure that you have selected the Evangelion capsule set by tapping the icon at the top of the Rare Capsule Machine page.<br>
※If Evangelion Collab Capsules fail to appear in the Rare Capsule Machine, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF0000|'''●Evangelion Collab Stages appear in The Battle Cats!'''}}<br>
Face off against terrifying collab-only enemies with your army of Evangelion characters! Take on the all new map {{Color|#008000|'''"Unit-13 Strikes!"'''}} in the second half of the collaboration!

{{Color|#008000|'''・Limited Stages "Evangelion Activates" & "Decisive Battle!"'''}}<br>
Visit the Stories of Legend/Event Stages during this collaboration to test your Cats at Evangelion collab stages!
Clear the {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Evangelion Activates!"'''}} stage for a change to receive the collab unit [[Shinji & Cat (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Shinji & Cat'''}}]]!<br>
Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Shinji & Cat! (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to receive this character!)<br>
Clearing {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Decisive Battle!"'''}} will earn you huge XP rewards!<br>
<small><small>※Activate Shinji & Cat by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※If Collab Stages fail to appear, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version.<br>
※Players who have already collected Shinji & Cat from a previous collab event will not be able to receive it again.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・Blitz Stages! Defend Tokyo-3 Against the Angels!'''}}<br>
The collab map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"The 9th Angel Strikes!"'''}} with extra-tough stages will be available at the times listed below! Can you smash the cruel Angels and hold off Third Impact?
*Even Dates (7/18, 7/20, 7/22, 7/24, 7/26, 7/28, 7/30)
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''12:00pm～1:59pm / 9:00pm～10:59pm'''}}
*Odd Dates (7/19, 7/21, 7/23, 7/25, 7/27, 7/29, 7/31)
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～8:59am / 5:00pm～6:59pm'''}}
*Last Collab Date (8/1)
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～10:59am'''}}

Clearing these stages will give you a chance to collect the limited edition collab character Giraffe Unit-01!
Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock [[Giraffe Unit-01 (Rare Cat)|{{Color|#FF0000|'''Giraffe Unit-01'''}}]]! (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a guaranteed chance to receive this character!)<br>
<small><small>※If Collab Stages fail to appear, make sure that you have updated the Battle Cats app to its most recent version<br>
※Players who have already collected Giraffe Unit-01 from a previous collab event will not be able to receive it again.</small></small>

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・After Day 5, challenge the Ultimate Refusal Type Angel!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''From the 5th day of the collab, (7/23)'''}}, collab map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"The 10th Angel Strikes!"'''}} will be available at the times listed below!
・Even Dates (7/24, 7/26, 7/28, 7/30)<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''12:00pm～1:59pm / 9:00pm～10:59pm'''}}<br>
・Odd Dates (7/23, 7/25, 7/27, 7/29, 7/31)<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～8:59am / 5:00pm～6:59pm'''}}<br>
・Last Collab Date (8/1)<br>
{{Color|#FF00CC|'''7:00am～10:59am'''}}

Clearing these stages will give you a chance to collect the True Form of limited edition collab character [[Kaworu & Cat (Special Cat)|{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Kaworu & Cat'''}}]]! Can you conquer these super-tough stages and pick up Kaworu's 3rd form?<br>
<small><small>※Upgrade Kaworu & Cat to level 20 to unlock its True Form.<br>
※Higher-difficulty stages will on this map will have a higher chance to unlock Kaworu & Cat's True Form!<br>
※Treasure Radar may be used on any stage for a guaranteed chance to receive Kaworu & Cat's True Form.<br>
※Players who have already collected Kaworu & Cat's True Form from a previous collab event will not be able to unlock it again.</small></small>

