{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・A weapon that should not exist! Face down the terrifying Unit-13!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''For the final half of the collab (starting 7/25)'''}}, collab map {{Color|#1ECCFF|'''"Unit-13 Strikes!"'''}} will be available at the times listed below!
・Even Dates (7/26, 7/28, 7/30)<br>
